96	     * internal runs of whitespace are collapsed to a single space, the value is
97	     * upper-cased, and common street-type abbreviations are expanded ({@code ST ->
98	     * STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}). A {@code null} value is
